  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>WF-load_all
The whole ETL, from the hospital files to the OMOP CDM, in this order:
1. WF-create_tables     creates any table that is not there yet
2. WF-load_reference    hand-kept CSV files -> reference tables
3. WF-load_sta          hospital files -> staging
4. WF-load_ods          staging -> ODS
5. WF-load_map          ODS -> ids and code mappings
6. WF-load_cdm          ODS + map -> OMOP CDM
Each step runs only when the previous one succeeded. Rejected rows: the adm schema.</note>
